{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51668","headline":"登卧龙山偶成 · 钱弘倧","name":"登卧龙山偶成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮山重叠势崔嵬，溢目清光入酒杯。\n几处烧残红树短，一帆航尽碧波来。\n安民未有移风术，徵句惭非梦锦才。\n四望楼台无限景，槛前赢得且徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘倧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}